	"title": "n8n Node Contract manifest",
	"description": "Generated from src/manifest.ts by scripts/spec.ts. Do not edit. `x-n8n-since` is the Node Contract version that added a field. The `contract.input` and `contract.output` schemas follow the contract format of the SDK.",
